Stop reporting metric `gen_ai.client.operation.duration` on internal agent, tool, and workflow invocations in favor of metrics `gen_ai.invoke_agent.duration`, `gen_ai.execute_tool.duration`, and `gen_ai.invoke_workflow.duration`. Stop reporting span attribute `gen_ai.conversation.compacted` on workflow and agent spans. Stop reporting span attributes `gen_ai.agent.id`, `gen_ai.agent.version`, and `gen_ai.usage.cache_*.input_tokens` on internal agent spans.
